@startuml
title ATM Control - Combined Scenarios

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Waiting for Customer Choice" as WaitingForChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state ProcessingTransaction
state ClosedDown

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt

ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Correct PIN / Display Options

WaitingForChoice --> ProcessingTransaction : User Choice / Process Selected Request
ProcessingTransaction --> ClosedDown : Transaction Approved / Dispense Cash and Print Receipt
ProcessingTransaction --> Confiscating : Invalid Card or Too Many Incorrect PINS / Keep Card
ProcessingTransaction --> Ejecting : User Cancels / Return Card
ProcessingTransaction --> Idle : No Cash / Stop Operation

ClosedDown --> Idle : Short End Phase / Reset ATM
@enduml
